{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19176","headline":"题于家公主旧宅 · 刘禹锡","name":"题于家公主旧宅","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"树绕荒台叶满池，箫声一绝草虫悲。\n邻家犹学宫人髻，园客争偷御果枝。\n马埒蓬蒿藏狡兔，凤楼烟雨啸愁鸱。\n何郎独在无恩泽，不似当初傅粉时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19176.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19176","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}